Error [E0220]: `data[…]` cannot be read while `window` has a live exclusive write window into it
  --> write_subrange_reborrow_keeps_sibling_windows_exclusive_2.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     edit[0] = U8{1}
    |     ^^^^
 Why: `window` is an exclusive window into `data[…][…]`; reading the owner beside that window would be rejected after lowering
 Fix: Read or edit through `window` instead of `data[…]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0220
